---
// Decorative: an AI assistant answer that lists competitors (generic names, no logos).
---
<div class="vg" aria-hidden="true">
  <p class="q">Welcher Anbieter für Leinenhemden ist gut?</p>
  <div class="a">
    <span class="av"></span>
    <div>
      <p>Empfehlenswert sind zum Beispiel:</p>
      <ol>
        <li>Marke A <span class="tag">genannt</span></li>
        <li>Marke B <span class="tag">genannt</span></li>
        <li>Deine Marke <span class="tag tag--miss">fehlt</span></li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
<style>
  .vg {
    border: 1px solid var(--line-2);
    border-radius: var(--r-10);
    background: rgba(7, 11, 18, 0.6);
    padding: 12px;
    font-size: 12px;
    display: grid;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .q {
    justify-self: end;
    max-width: 85%;
    padding: 6px 10px;
    border-radius: 10px 10px 2px 10px;
    background: var(--surface-2);
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .a {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 18px 1fr;
    gap: 8px;
    color: var(--text-2);
  }
  .av {
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: conic-gradient(from 90deg, var(--accent-deep), #3b4a66, var(--accent-deep));
  }
  ol {
    padding-left: 16px;
    margin-top: 4px;
    display: grid;
    gap: 3px;
  }
  .tag {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10.5px;
    color: var(--text-3);
    margin-left: 4px;
  }
  .tag--miss {
    color: var(--warn);
  }
</style>
